{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["And YHWH said to her — through a prophet." "Two nations — do not fear, for the distress of your pregnancy is because two twins are in your womb, since the pregnancy-distress of two is greater than that of one." "And two peoples — kingdoms, as written: מלכי ארץ וכל לאמים. It is a doubled expression. But לאומים means 'peoples,' and since the prophet began to speak to her, he went on and explained to her everything that was to come." "And the elder shall serve the younger — and therefore you loved Jacob, for the Holy One, blessed be He, loved him, as written: ואהב את יעקב."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:15.782819570Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}